agedoor 50: A One-Night-Only Concert celebrating 50 Years of Stagedoor Mano
 
r Benefiting the Entertainment Community Fund with appearances by Erich Ber
 
gen\, Michael Ian Black\, Zach Braff\, Josh Charles\, Jon Cryer\, Sofia Hub
 
litz\, Shawn Levy\, Julia Murney\, Chris Olsen\, Larry Owens\, Adam Pascal\
 
