nt will celebrate the legendary performing arts training center?s past\, pr
 
esent and future\, featuring an incredible lineup of Stagedoor Manor alumni
 
 and friends coming together to honor the place they call home. 100% of the
 
 proceeds will benefit the Entertainment Community Fund?s programs that add
 
ress the unique needs of people who work in performing arts and entertainme
 
nt with services focused on health and wellness\, career and life\, and hou
 
sing. *Artists subject to change Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.c
 
