SUMMARY:The Cabaret Burlesque presents: Code Red
LOCATION:Berlin
DESCRIPTION:VIP experience includes: meet and greet and champagne TCB prese
 
nts: CODE RED Code Red: Industry Night Weekly on Monday Doors 7:30pm Iris R
 
odrigo 8pm Main Show featuring The Cabaret Burlesque 8:30 - 10:30pm Music a
 
nd Bar until 1am Contact @thecabaretburlesque on instagram to APPLY to perf
 
orm as an Opening Act An Industry Night where your wildest fantasies just m
 
ight come true. Welcome to CODE RED---an electrifying world where Parisian 
 
cabaret meets Amsterdam's edge\, Moscow's mystique\, and the unapologetic g
 
lamour of Studio 54. Fashion is as much a part of the performance as the ar
 
tists themselves\, with striking couture\, bold silhouettes\, and runway-wo
 
rthy style setting the scene for an unforgettable night. Expect dazzling pe
 
rformances\, intoxicating music\, provocative artistry\, and immersive mome
 
nts that blur the line between audience and spectacle. Inspired by the gold
 
en age of nightlife\, where icons\, artists\, and dreamers came to see and 
 
be seen\, CODE RED celebrates fearless self-expression\, decadent entertain
 
ment\, and the thrill of the unexpected. Dress boldly. Stay curious. Bring 
 
your calling card. Welcome to the show where fantasy\, fashion\, and nightl
 
ife collide. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-cabaret-bu
 
rlesque-presents-code-berlin-tickets/14285474
